                            <comment id="15505633" author="prabhjyotsingh" created="Tue, 20 Sep 2016 05:29:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Can you share your interpreter settings ? &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;java.sql.SQLException: No suitable driver found for &lt;a href=&quot;http://localhost:8765&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://localhost:8765&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;suggest either artifact/dependencies  not supplied or they are incorrect.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15505750" author="randerzander" created="Tue, 20 Sep 2016 06:25:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Properties&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;name	value&lt;br/&gt;
common.max_count	1000&lt;br/&gt;
phoenix.driver	org.apache.phoenix.queryserver.client.Driver&lt;br/&gt;
phoenix.hbase.client.retries.number	1&lt;br/&gt;
phoenix.password	&lt;br/&gt;
phoenix.url	jdbc:phoenix:thin:url=&lt;a href=&quot;http://localhost:8765;serialization=PROTOBUF&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://localhost:8765;serialization=PROTOBUF&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
phoenix.user	phoenixuser&lt;br/&gt;
zeppelin.interpreter.localRepo	/Users/randy/projects/zeppelin/local-repo/2BY1MRBEA&lt;br/&gt;
zeppelin.jdbc.auth.type	&lt;br/&gt;
zeppelin.jdbc.concurrent.max_connection	10&lt;br/&gt;
zeppelin.jdbc.concurrent.use	false&lt;br/&gt;
Dependencies&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;artifact&lt;br/&gt;
org.apache.phoenix:phoenix-server-client:4.7.0-HBase-1.1	&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;All needed artifacts are present.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See the description above- the first query succeeds, and the debug output shows properties as expected. However, the second paragraph&apos;s query &quot;select * from system.catalog&quot; shows debug output suggesting that the JDBC interpreter properties get mangled after the first paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m still not sure why.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
